  "tool": "brain_delegate_task",
  "args": {
    "persona": "architect",
    "intent": "Please retrieve the 'Architectural Principles' and 'Target GCP Architecture Blueprint' documents. Concurrently, gather detailed inventory data for each of the 100 AWS microservices. For each service, provide the following information in a structured JSON format as specified:\n- **Dependencies:** Map out all dependencies (databases, caches, message queues, other microservices, external APIs).\n- **Statefulness:** Determine if the service is stateless or stateful, and how state is managed.\n- **Configuration & Secrets:** Identify how configuration and secrets are currently managed.\n- **Resource Profile:** Document current CPU/memory allocation and utilization metrics.\n- **Network Profile:** Analyze ingress/egress patterns and security groups.\n\nHere is the requested JSON schema for each microservice entry:\n```json\n{\n  \"microservice_name\": \"<string>\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"databases\": [\n      {\"type\": \"RDS\" | \"DynamoDB\" | \"Aurora\", \"identifier\": \"<string>\"},\n      {\"type\": \"other_db\", \"details\": \"<string>\"}\n    ],\n    \"caches\": [\n      {\"type\": \"ElastiCache\" | \"Redis\" | \"Memcached\", \"cluster_name\": \"<string>\"}\n    ],\n    \"message_queues\": [\n      {\"type\": \"SQS\" | \"SNS\" | \"Kafka\" | \"Kinesis\", \"identifier\": \"<string>\"}\n    ],\n    \"other_microservices\": [\n      {\"service_name\": \"<string>\", \"communication_method\": \"API Gateway\" | \"Direct HTTP\" | \"RPC\" | \"Event\"}\n    ],\n    \"external_apis\": [\n      {\"api_endpoint\": \"<string>\", \"purpose\": \"<string>\"}\n    ]\n  },\n  \"statefulness\": {\n    \"is_stateful\": \"<boolean>\",\n    \"state_management_details\": \"<string>\"\n  },\n  \"configuration_and_secrets\": {\n    \"config_management_method\": \"AWS Parameter Store\" | \"AWS Secrets Manager\" | \"Environment Variables\" | \"Config Files\" | \"Other\",\n    \"secrets_management_method\": \"AWS Secrets Manager\" | \"Environment Variables\" | \"Other\",\n    \"examples_of_secrets\": [\"<string>\"]\n  },\n  \"resource_profile\": {\n    \"compute_type\": \"AWS Lambda\" | \"ECS Fargate\" | \"EC2\" | \"EKS\" | \"Other\",\n    \"allocated_cpu\": \"<string> (e.g., '1 vCPU', '256 units')\",\n    \"allocated_memory\": \"<string> (e.g., '512MB', '2GB')\",\n    \"avg_cpu_utilization_percent\": \"<number>\",\n    \"peak_cpu_utilization_percent\": \"<number>\",\n    \"avg_memory_utilization_percent\": \"<number>\",\n    \"peak_memory_utilization_percent\": \"<number>\"\n  },\n  \"network_profile\": {\n    \"security_groups\": [\"<string> (e.g., 'sg-0123456789abcdef0')\"],\n    \"ingress_patterns\": \"<string> (e.g., 'HTTPS from ALB', 'Internal RPC from service-X')\",\n    \"egress_patterns\": \"<string> (e.g., 'HTTPS to RDS', 'HTTPS to external API')\",\n    \"vpc_details\": \"<string> (e.g., 'VPC ID: vpc-0abcdef1234567890, Subnets: private-1, private-2')\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOnce this information is collected, please provide it back to me, the Researcher, so I can proceed with the analysis to identify pilot wave candidates and finalize the structured inventory artifact. Ensure the list of 100 microservices is provided as an array of these JSON objects, along with the two architectural documents."
  }
}
